# Design System

The app is **dark-by-default** (not a togglable theme). Styling is **Tailwind v3** with default tokens — no custom palette in `tailwind.config.js`. All design tokens are expressed as utility classes in templates.

## Color Palette

| Role                   | Tokens                                                     |
| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Background / shell** | `bg-black`, `bg-neutral-950`, `bg-neutral-900`             |
| **Cards / surfaces**   | `bg-neutral-800`, `bg-neutral-900`                         |
| **Borders**            | `border-neutral-800`, `border-neutral-700`                 |
| **Muted text**         | `text-neutral-400`, `text-neutral-500`                     |
| **Body text**          | `text-neutral-200`, `text-neutral-100`, `text-white`       |
| **Primary accent**     | `purple-500` / `purple-400` — buttons, rings, board chrome |
| **Primary muted**      | `purple-900/15`, `purple-500/20` — hover backgrounds       |
| **Assign / info**      | `cyan-*`                                                   |
| **Archive / warning**  | `amber-*`                                                  |
| **Destructive**        | `red-*`                                                    |

**Focus rings:** `focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400` (or `/30`–`/50` variants for subtlety).

## Spacing & Layout

- **Gaps:** `gap-2`, `gap-3`, `gap-4`, `gap-8`; lists use `space-y-2` / `space-y-3`.
- **Padding:** inputs `px-3 py-2.5`; sections `p-4`–`p-8`; section rhythm `mb-4`, `mb-6`, `mb-8`.
- **Border radius:** `rounded-lg` / `rounded-xl` for cards and modals; `rounded-md` for chips and badges.
- **Max width:** content `max-w-[960px]`, wide boards `max-w-[1600px]`, modals `max-w-2xl` / `max-w-md`.
- **Scrollable flex regions:** always pair `flex-1 min-h-0` on the scroll container — without `min-h-0`, flex children will not scroll inside a flex column.

```html
<!-- ✅ Correct scroll region -->
<div class="flex flex-col flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-y-auto scrollbar-dark"></div>
```

## Custom Utilities

- **`.scrollbar-dark`** (defined in `styles.css`) — apply to any scrollable column or panel. Do not replicate inline.

## Typography

- No custom font loaded; uses Tailwind's default sans stack.
- Weights: `font-medium`, `font-semibold`, `font-bold`.
- Sizes: `text-xs` → `text-2xl`; use arbitrary `text-[0.9375rem]` only when standard steps don't fit.
- `tracking-tight` for headings; `tracking-wide uppercase` for labels / column headers; `tabular-nums` for numeric values.

## Motion

- Loading spinners: `animate-spin` on a bordered `<div>` with accent `border-t-*`.
- Hover: `transition-colors`, `transition-all`, `hover:border-*`, `hover:shadow-md`.
- Expanding panels (archive rail): `transition-[width] duration-200 ease-out` via computed class.
- Keep animations subtle — no dramatic keyframe animations unless specifically designed.

## Component Patterns

- **Buttons:** primary = `bg-purple-500 hover:bg-purple-400 text-white`; ghost = `text-neutral-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-neutral-800`.
- **Inputs:** `bg-neutral-800 border border-neutral-700 rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-400 focus:outline-none`.
- **Cards:** `bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-xl p-4`.
- **Modals:** centered, `max-w-2xl`, `bg-neutral-900 rounded-xl border border-neutral-800`.

## Rules

- Do **not** extend `tailwind.config.js` with one-off custom values — use Tailwind's default scale or arbitrary values in markup.
- Do **not** add a `dark:` prefix — the app is always dark.
- Do **not** use `ngClass` or `ngStyle`. Use `[class]` / `[style]` bindings or `host` metadata.
